(i) avoir complété au moins douze mois de service actif ininterrom",2f2855bb-8fd0-475b-b9a3-02d5b3e4f442,0.0161,0.0121,0.0161,"16.05 Unless otherwise stated in this Agreement, promotions shall be effective on 1 July of the
