test_de_005,Was gilt laut Vereinbarung für die berufliche Weiterbildung?,9e63d0bc-1639-442e-b04e-e2b12c6fd7b5,0.3339,0.2838,0.0164,"30.07 Sessional Members shall be eligible for professional development money of two hundred and
