30.01 Each full-time Member shall be eligible to receive a professional allowance for each
contractual year, such allowance to be spent for expenses related to approved academic
research or professional purposes. Such an allowance shall be cumulative over two (2)
academic years.",2f2855bb-8fd0-475b-b9a3-02d5b3e4f442,0.0161,0.0121,0.0161,"16.05 Unless otherwise stated in this Agreement, promotions shall be effective on 1 July of the
academic year following the year in which the application was made and approved. A
Lecturer who obtains a doctoral degree shall have an approved promotion to Assistant
Professor. The promotion shall be effective the first day of the month following the
University receiving a diploma or a letter from the University where the doctorate was
obtained, that indicates all conditions for the doctorate h",12089275-858a-4036-bb55-e7d528cd19d8,0.3271,0.2453,0.0159,"ARTICLE 30 — PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT
30.01 Each full-time Member shall be eligible to receive a professional allowance for each
contractual year, such allowance to be spent for expenses related to approved academic
research or professional purposes. Such an allowance shall be cumulative over two (2)
academic years.","Laut Artikel 30 des LUFA-H-Kollektivvertrags 2016-2020, Seite 47, sind Sessionale Mitglieder für die Bezahlung von Weiterbildungsmitteln in Höhe von 250 $ pro jede drei Kreditstunden lehrender Kurs bis zu einer Obergrenze von 2.000 $ berechtigt. Doch wie bereits in Artikel 30.01 angesprochen, sind Vollzeitmitglieder für jedes Vertragsjahr zum Bezug eines Berufszulages berechtigt, das für Ausgaben im Zusammenhang mit genehmigter akademischer Forschung oder beruflicher Zwecke verwendet werden darf.",llama3.1:8b,de,1,True,True,What is agreed for further education in a profession?,"According to Article 30 of the LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020, page 47, Sessional Members are eligible for professional development money of $250 per each three credit course they teach up to a limit of $2,000. However, as noted in Article 30.01, full-time Members shall be eligible to receive a professional allowance for each contractual year, such allowance to be spent for expenses related to approved academic research or professional purposes.

(Note: The question's wording ""What is agreed for further education in a profession?"" seems to refer more generally to the concept of continuing education, rather than specifically to sessional members' professional development money. In that case, the answer would be that full-time Members are eligible for a professional allowance related to approved academic research or professional purposes.)",en
test_de_012,Was sieht der Tarifvertrag bezüglich des Rechts auf Rückruf vor?,79e5c279-ce00-43ab-8971-02035017af63,0.4723,0.4605,0.0313,"Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such
recall offer, and shall terminate their alternative employment and take up the offered post, as soon
as they are contractually able to do so but in no instance later than six (6) months after accepting the
recall offer.
(c) Reasonable efforts by the Employer to assist a laid-off Member in obtaining alternative employment
including the use of professional assistance as well as access to Universi",e5ce47c9-3f36-4212-9b9b-57ddf7df2970,0.4627,0.2198,0.0311,"Disputes
arising out of these recall procedures are referable to the Grievance and
Arbitration process set out in this Agreement. Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to
thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer, and shall terminate their
alternative employment and take up the offered post, as soon as they are
contractually able to do so but in no instance later than six (6) months
after accepting the recall offer.
c) Reasonable efforts by the Board to assist a ",472fac89-202f-466b-bcef-65b6106474d1,0.4722,0.3306,0.0308,"Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this
Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer, and shall terminate their alternative employment and
take up the offered post, as soon as they are contractually able to do so but in no instance later than six
(6) months after accepting the recall offer.
(c) Reasonable efforts by the Employer to assist a laid-off Member in obtaining alternative employment including the use
of professional assistance as well as access to Universi",be03dc4b-1e1c-4321-8193-782df6a3804e,0.4722,0.3306,0.0303,"Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this
Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer, and shall terminate their alternative employment and
take up the offered post, as soon as they are contractually able to do so but in no instance later than six
(6) months after accepting the recall offer.
(c) Reasonable efforts by the Employer to assist a laid-off Member in obtaining alternative employment including the use
of professional assistance as well as access to Universi",d97b0c0f-ce6e-469f-99eb-50f9c9f59e41,0.4457,0.3788,0.0302,"Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to thirty
(30) days to accept such recall offer, and shall terminate their alternative employment and take up the offered post, as
soon as they are contractually able to do so but in no instance later than six (6) months after accepting the recall offer.
(c) Reasonable efforts by the Employer to assist a laid-off Member in obtaining alternative employment including the use
of professional assistance as well as access to Universi","Laut dem Kollektivvertrag haben Personen, die gemäß diesem Artikel wieder eingezogen werden sollen, höchstens dreißig (30) Tage Zeit, eine solche Rückrufangebote anzunehmen und ihre alternative Beschäftigung zu beenden und die angebotene Position aufzunehmen, sobald sie dazu vertraglich in der Lage sind, aber spätestens sechs (6) Monate nachdem sie das Rückrufangebot angenommen haben. Dies wird in verschiedenen Abschnitten des Vertrags erwähnt, einschließlich:

* 10.15.22 (Kollektivvertrag 2011-14, Seite 188): Personen, die gemäß diesem Artikel wieder eingezogen werden sollen, haben höchstens dreißig (30) Tage Zeit, eine solche Rückrufangebote anzunehmen...
* 11.15.23 (Kollektivvertrag 2002-2005, Seite 122): Personen, die gemäß diesem Artikel wieder eingezogen werden sollen, haben höchstens dreißig (30) Tage Zeit, eine solche Rückrufangebote anzunehmen...
* 10.15.22 (Kollektivvertrag 2017-2020, Seite unbekannt): Personen, die gemäß diesem Artikel wieder eingezogen werden sollen, haben höchstens dreißig (30) Tage Zeit, eine solche Rückrufangebote anzunehmen...

Dies bedeutet, dass beurlaubte Mitglieder, die an die Stelle bei der Laurentian University zurückberufen werden, einen bestimmten Zeitrahmen haben, in dem sie auf das Angebot reagieren und es annehmen müssen.",llama3.1:8b,de,2,True,True,What does the collective agreement say about the right to recall?,"According to the collective agreement, Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer, and shall terminate their alternative employment and take up the offered post, as soon as they are contractually able to do so but in no instance later than six (6) months after accepting the recall offer. This is stated in various sections of the agreement, including:

* 10.15.22 (Collective Agreement 2011-14, page 188): Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer...
* 11.15.23 (Collective Agreement 2002-2005, page 122): Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer...
* 10.15.22 (Collective Agreement 2017-2020, page unknown): Individuals who are recalled pursuant to this Article shall have up to thirty (30) days to accept such recall offer...

This means that laid-off members who are recalled to their positions at Laurentian University have a specific timeframe in which they must respond to and accept the recall offer.",en
