a) The Chair of the HUFAC shall be appointed by the President of the University and
shall not be a member of Laurentian University Faculty Association. The Chair of
HUFAC shall appoint the committee Membership with the approval of the Joint
Labour Management Committee.
b) The committee shall consist of five (5) tenured Huntington Members, plus the Chair,
except as outlined in 14.02 b) (ii), (iii) and (iv) below.
(i) Any shortfall in Huntington Members shall be selected wit",4b3dfb01-42c9-4d90-a9e3-df2a30fcb64e,0.0161,0.0101,0.0161,"INNIS
