Collective Agreement 2008-11
CLARITY NOTE:
For the purposes of clarity, the parties agree that the bargaining unit does not include full-time faculty on reduced
assignments, persons employed through the
Centre for Continuing Education, persons employed to teach courses primarily for students who are not registered in a
degree credit programme, persons not assigned responsibili",31c75c8a-bb49-40f0-8681-20ada3afcd5e,0.4449,0.3559,0.0159,"8.06 Procedures
(a) Quorum shall consist of the chair and the five elected faculty members. Where an elected faculty member is unable to
attend the alternate shall be appointed.
The faculty member must contact the Chair to advise of his/her non-attendance so appropriate documentation can be
forwarded to the alternate.
(b) Members of the Committee are required to keep strict confidentiality on all matters discussed at meetings, especially
the identity and comments of referees.
(c) The Committee s","Gemäß der Kollektivvereinbarung gelten folgende Bestimmungen für das HUFAC (Huntington University Faculty Affairs Committee):

* Der Vorsitzende des HUFAC wird vom Präsidenten der Universität bestimmt und ist kein Mitglied der Laurentian University Faculty Association. (Quelle: LUFA-H-Kollektivvereinbarung 2016-2020, Seite 24)
* Die Kommission besteht aus fünf (5) beauftragten Huntington-Mitgliedern plus dem Vorsitzenden, außer in den Fällen b) (ii), (iii) und (iv). (Quelle: LUFA-H-Kollektivvereinbarung 2016-2020, Seite 24)
* Der Quorum besteht aus dem Vorsitzenden und den fünf gewählten Fakultätsmitgliedern. Sollte ein gewähltes Fakultätsmitglied nicht anwesend sein, wird das Ersatzmitglied bestimmt. (Quelle: Kollektivvereinbarung 2015-2018, Seite 13)
* Die Mitglieder der Kommission sind verpflichtet, alle Angelegenheiten, die bei den Sitzungen besprochen wurden, streng vertraulich zu behandeln. (Quelle: Kollektivvereinbarung 2015-2018, Seite 13)
* Die Kommission soll mindestens vierteljährlich tagen, es sei denn, in dem Quartal gibt es keine Geschäfte zu besprechen. (Quelle: Kollektivvereinbarung 2015-2018, Seite 13)

Hinweis: Eine vollständige Beschreibung der Rolle und Verantwortungen des HUFACs ist im Artikel 14 - HUFAC der Kollektivvereinbarung zu finden.",llama3.1:8b,de,2,True,True,What applies according to agreement for hufac?,"According to the Collective Agreement, the following provisions apply with respect to HUFAC (Huntington University Faculty Affairs Committee):

* The Chair of HUFAC shall be appointed by the President of the University and shall not be a member of Laurentian University Faculty Association. (Source: LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020, page 24)
* The committee shall consist of five (5) tenured Huntington Members, plus the Chair, except as outlined in clauses b) (ii), (iii) and (iv). (Source: LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020, page 24)
* Quorum shall consist of the chair and the five elected faculty members. Where an elected faculty member is unable to attend, the alternate shall be appointed. (Source: Collective Agreement 2015-2018, page 13)
* Members of the Committee are required to keep strict confidentiality on all matters discussed at meetings. (Source: Collective Agreement 2015-2018, page 13)
* The committee shall meet at least quarterly unless there is no business to conduct in that quarter. (Source: Collective Agreement 2015-2018, page 13)

Note that the full description of HUFAC's role and responsibilities can be found in Article 14 - HUFAC of the Collective Agreement.",en
