Expenditures for Sessional Members (Counsellors only), Article 5.25 – Employment Equi",eb039a58-942e-4d46-bdb0-39d62b71f7a5,0.0164,0.0115,0.0164,"ARTICLE 7.35 – VOLUNTARY REDUCED WORKLOAD
