Barr",fbe12a26-27c9-4ab4-985b-27d9809cb72f,0.3243,0.3161,0.0161,"To that end, the Employer has established a Human Rights Office, headed by a Human Rights Advisor
and has created a discrimination and harassment policy.
3.15.2 The Parties agree that in accordance with the provisions of the Human Rights Code of Ontario there shall
be no discrimination or harassment exercised or practiced with respect to any Member in regard to
salaries, rank, appointment, promotion, tenure, reappointment, dismissal, leaves, benefits, or any other
matter arising from this F",2f2855bb-8fd0-475b-b9a3-02d5b3e4f442,0.0161,0.0121,0.0161,"16.05 Unless otherwise stated in this Agreement, promotions shall be effective on 1 July of the
academic year following the year in which the application was made and approved. A
Lecturer who obtains a doctoral degree shall have an approved promotion to Assistant
Professor. The promotion shall be effective the first day of the month following the
University receiving a diploma or a letter from the University where the doctorate was
obtained, that indicates all conditions for the doctorate h",658662d3-0c53-4e6f-85e3-dd2d824a87ea,0.338,0.2873,0.0159,"ARTICLE 3 — NO DISCRIMINATION
3.01 Human Rights Code: The Parties agree to abide by the Ontario Human Rights Code. There
shall be no discrimination or harassment exercised or practiced with respect to any Member
regardless of salary, rank, appointment, promotion, tenure, reappointment, dismissal,
leaves, benefits, or any other matter arising from this Collective Agreement, for reasons of
age, race, language, creed, colour, ancestry, ethnic or cultural background, national origin,
political","Gemäß der Kollektivvereinbarung (Quelldokumentname: ARTIKEL 3 - KEINE DISKRIMINIERUNG) besteht keine Diskriminierung oder Belästigung gegenüber irgendeinem Mitglied unter Berücksichtigung des Gehalts, des Ranges, der Ernennung, der Beförderung, der Tenure, der Wiedereinsetzung, der Entlassung, der Urlaube, der Vorteile oder jedes anderen Anliegens, das sich aus dieser Kollektivvereinbarung ergibt.

Die Parteien verpflichten sich zur Einhaltung des Ontario Human Rights Code (Quelldokumentname: ARTIKEL 3 - KEINE DISKRIMINIERUNG, nicht angegebene Seite) und es besteht keine Diskriminierung oder Belästigung gegenüber irgendeinem Mitglied wegen Alters, Rasse, Sprache, Glauben, Farbe, Abstammung, ethnischer oder kultureller Hintergrund, nationaler Herkunft, politischer oder religiöser Überzeugungen.

Daher hat die Universität bei einem Fall der Diskriminierung eine Human Rights Office (Quelldokumentname: 3.15.2) eingerichtet, geleitet von einer Beraterin für Menschenrechte und ein Diskriminierungs- und Belästigungsrichtlinie erstellt hat, um solche Angelegenheiten anzugehen.",llama3.1:8b,de,1,True,True,What will happen in relation to the prohibition of discrimination?,"According to the collective agreement (source document name: ARTICLE 3 — NO DISCRIMINATION), there shall be no discrimination or harassment exercised or practiced with respect to any Member regardless of salary, rank, appointment, promotion, tenure, reappointment, dismissal, leaves, benefits, or any other matter arising from this Collective Agreement.

The Parties agree to abide by the Ontario Human Rights Code (source document name: ARTICLE 3 — NO DISCRIMINATION, page not specified) and there shall be no discrimination or harassment exercised or practiced with respect to any Member for reasons of age, race, language, creed, colour, ancestry, ethnic or cultural background, national origin, political or religious beliefs.

Therefore, if there is a case of discrimination, the University has established a Human Rights Office (source document name: 3.15.2) headed by a Human Rights Advisor and has created a discrimination and harassment policy to address such matters.",en
