(b) And on such other holidays as declared by the Employer, including the cu",1ae30de3-c792-4b47-a6d3-6147f1740182,0.428,0.2033,0.0286,"ARTICLE 3.0 - RECOGNIZED AND OTHER HOLIDAYS
